<title>JAPAN: Kureha Chemical -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Kureha Chemical -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 45.92		vs	   45.91</p>
<p> Operating	prft 189 million	  vs   loss 766    million</p>
<p> Current	   prft 81 million	  vs   loss 650    million</p>
<p> Net	     loss 2.21		vs   loss 665    million</p>
<p> EPS	     loss 9.98 yen	  vs     loss 3.00 yen</p>
<p> Shares	    222 million	  vs	 222 million</p>
<p> Interim div	   nil		vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Kureha Chemical Industry Co Ltd is a chemical maker.</p>
